  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal and design of the new Access to health care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Appraisal and design of the new Access to health care is a component of Access to Health Care in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;8,306,238. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Basic health care, STD control including HIV/AIDS, Reproductive health care, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
